WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:05.060
Another Thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the SCP Foundation: Trick or treat!

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.290
We all like a little Halloween fun, Jack,
but there are limits!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:12.870
And after that horrific incident where SCP-106
managed to escape on Halloween night and cause

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:17.240
chaos,
or that absurd incident where SCP-3114 escaped

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.830
on Halloween night, we really just want to
keep all anomalous things indoors this spooky

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:22.830
season!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.349
Is that so much to ask, Jack?

